[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12420.95, "timestamp": "03:27:00", "text": "为了？月亮车毛皮羽毛。总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12422.71, "timestamp": "03:27:02", "text": "我自己收集这些东西很困难"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12425.55, "timestamp": "03:27:05", "text": "那只鸟总是消失。厚脸皮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12427.75, "timestamp": "03:27:07", "text": "事物。以前用来在店里搬运它们，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12430.309, "timestamp": "03:27:10", "text": "平局。但人们仍然不断地要求他们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12431.99, "timestamp": "03:27:11", "text": "他们回家后会把钱退还给他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12433.59, "timestamp": "03:27:13", "text": "该死的东西根本就没地方去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12436.349, "timestamp": "03:27:16", "text": "视力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12439.83, "timestamp": "03:27:19", "text": "哇，听起来真令人沮丧。我能想象"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12441.99, "timestamp": "03:27:21", "text": "那会相当令人沮丧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12444.469, "timestamp": "03:27:24", "text": "还有更糟的情况。相信我，大多数"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12446.63, "timestamp": "03:27:26", "text": "羽毛供应商也可能是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12450.15, "timestamp": "03:27:30", "text": "住在圣蒙戈斯。不出所料，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12453.51, "timestamp": "03:27:33", "text": "认为。对那些事情的呼声。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12456.71, "timestamp": "03:27:36", "text": "但如此精美的羽毛几乎值"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12458.389, "timestamp": "03:27:38", "text": "为之疯狂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12459.99, "timestamp": "03:27:39", "text": "听起来像是要把货架摆满。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12462.51, "timestamp": "03:27:42", "text": "但也存在一些危险。至理名言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12465.67, "timestamp": "03:27:45", "text": "说。过去用来驮运牲畜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12467.67, "timestamp": "03:27:47", "text": "这是一笔不错的生意。但加起来就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12470.469, "timestamp": "03:27:50", "text": "耳边传来父母的抱怨声。不是我的错"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12472.429, "timestamp": "03:27:52", "text": "如果小家伙们被跳蚤叮咬了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12475.67, "timestamp": "03:27:55", "text": "画架。你应该听听他们说的话。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12478.389, "timestamp": "03:27:58", "text": "最好使用副产品。而且我确实喜欢"}]